{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 83,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "God, don’t keep silent. be still, God.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，求你不要静默！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，求你不要靜默！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "For, behold, your enemies are stirred up.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为你的仇敌喧嚷，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為你的仇敵喧嚷，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "They conspire with cunning against your people. They plot against your cherished ones.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们同谋奸诈要害你的百姓，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們同謀奸詐要害你的百姓，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "“Come,” they say, “let’s destroy them as a nation, that the name of Israel may be remembered no more.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们说：来吧，我们将他们剪灭， 的名不再被人记念！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們說：來吧，我們將他們剪滅， 的名不再被人記念！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "For they have conspired together with one mind. They form an alliance against you.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们同心商议，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們同心商議，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "The tents of Edom and the Ishmaelites; and the Hagrites;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "就是住帐棚的人和人， 和人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "就是住帳棚的人和人， 和人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Gebal, Ammon, and Amalek; of Tyre;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "、， 、并的居民。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "、， 、並的居民。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Assyria also is joined with them. They have helped the children of Lot.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "也与他们连合； 子孙的帮手。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "也與他們連合； 子孫的幫手。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "Do to them as you did to Midian, as to Sisera, as to Jabin, at the river Kishon;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "求你待他们，如待， 待和一样。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "求你待他們，如待， 待和一樣。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "who perished at Endor, who became as dung for the earth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们在灭亡，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們在滅亡，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "Make their nobles like Oreb and Zeeb, their princes like Zebah and Zalmunna,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "求你叫他们的首领像和， 和。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "求你叫他們的首領像和， 和。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "who said, “Let’s take possession of God’s pasture lands.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他们说：我们要得 神的住处，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他們說：我們要得上帝的住處，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "My God, make them like tumbleweed, the wind.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我的 神啊，求你叫他们像旋风的尘土，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我的上帝啊，求你叫他們像旋風的塵土，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "As the fire that burns the forest, as the flame that sets the mountains on fire,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "火怎样焚烧树林，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "火怎樣焚燒樹林，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "so pursue them with your tempest, and terrify them with your storm.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "求你也照样用狂风追赶他们，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "求你也照樣用狂風追趕他們，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "Fill their faces with confusion, that they may seek your name, LORD.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "愿你使他们满面羞耻，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "願你使他們滿面羞恥，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "Let them be disappointed and dismayed forever. them be confounded and perish;",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "愿他们永远羞愧惊惶！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "願他們永遠羞愧驚惶！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "that they may know that you alone, whose name is the LORD, the Most High over all the earth.",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "83:18 LORD or GOD in all caps is from the Hebrew יהוה Yahweh except when otherwise noted as being from the short form יה Yah."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "使他们知道：惟独你—",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "使他們知道：惟獨你－",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}